d\" class=\"lucide lucide-award w-4 h-4 text-gray-900\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg><span>Program Haji Khusus &amp; Furoda 1448 H / 2027</span></div><h1 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight font-sans leading-tight\">Pendaftaran <span class=\"text-[#F5B027]\">Haji Furoda VIP</span> (Langsung Berangkat)</h1><p class=\"text-purple-100 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed\">Tunaikan rukun Islam kelima tanpa perlu menunggu antrean puluhan tahun. Menggunakan **Visa Mujamalah Resmi Kerajaan Arab Saudi** yang terdaftar secara sah di Kemenag RI (PIHK).</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 pt-2\"><a href=\"#haji-catalog\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-[#F5B027] hover:bg-amber-500 text-gray-900 font-extrabold px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl shadow-lg transition-all text-sm\"><span>Lihat Paket Haji Furoda</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"https://wa.me/6281234567890?text=Assalamu%27alaikum%20Amanah%20Safar%20Marhaban,%20saya%20konsultasi%20pendaftaran%20Haji%20Furoda\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white font-bold border border-white/30 px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl transition-all text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone-call w-4 h-4 text-[#F5B027]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13 2a9 9 0 0 1 9 9\"></path><path d=\"M13 6a5 5 0 0 1 5 5\"></path><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384\"></path></svg><span>Konsultasi Haji VIP</span></a></div></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-2xs space-y-2\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-950/60 text-[#4B2476] dark:text-[#F5B027] flex items-center justify-center font-bold\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-check w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"m9 15 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-extrabold text-base text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">Visa Furoda Resmi</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed\">Visa Mujamalah langsung terbit dari Kementerian Hajj &amp; Umrah Saudi Arabia.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-2xs space-y-2\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-950/60 text-[#4B2476] dark:text-[#F5B027] flex items-center justify-center font-bold\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-building w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 10h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 6h.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 10h.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 6h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 10h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 6h.01\"></path><path d=\"M9 22v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h4a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><rect x=\"4\" y=\"2\" width=\"16\" height=\"20\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-extrabold text-base text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">Maktab &amp; Tenda VIP</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed\">Fasilitas tenda ber-AC full board catering di Arafah &amp; Mina dekat jamarat.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-2xs space-y-2\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-100 dark:bg-purple-950/60 text-[#4B2476] dark:text-[#F5B027] flex items-center justify-center font-bold\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-extrabold text-base text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">Pembimbing Senior</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed\">Bimbingan manasik intensif oleh Ulama &amp; Pembimbing Syari&#x27;ah terkemuka.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-2xs space-y-2\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-950/60 text-[#4B2476] dark:text-[#F5B027] flex items-center justify-center font-bold\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v3\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v3\"></path><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 9h18\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-extrabold text-base text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">Tanpa Antrean</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed\">Berangkat langsung di musim haji tahun berjalan tanpa perlu antre lama.</p></div></div><div id=\"haji-catalog\" class=\"space-y-6 pt-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4\"><div><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-sans\">Katalog Program Haji VIP</h2><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">Pilihan paket perjalanan haji eksklusif dengan pelayanan kelas satu.</p></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between group relative\"><div class=\"relative md:w-5/12 h-64 md:h-auto overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 shrink-0\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542314831-068cd1dbfeeb?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1200&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Program Haji Furoda / Mujamalah VIP\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-black/20 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 bg-[#F5B027] text-gray-900 font-extrabold text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow-md\">Haji Furoda</div><div class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-3 right-3 text-white\"><span class=\"text-xs bg-black/50 backdrop-blur-md px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md block w-fit mb-1\">Durasi: <!-- -->25 Hari 24 Malam</span><span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-300\">★ <!-- -->5<!-- --> (<!-- -->19<!-- --> ulasan)</span></div></div><div class=\"p-6 md:w-7/12 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h3 class=\"font-extrabold text-xl text-gray-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-[#4B2476] dark:group-hover:text-[#F5B027] transition-colors leading-snug\">Program Haji Furoda / Mujamalah VIP</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed\">Ibadah Haji Khusus menggunakan Visa Mujamalah Resmi Kerajaan Arab Saudi yang terdaftar di Kemenag RI tanpa antrean.</p><ul class=\"space-y-1.5 pt-2 text-xs text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Visa Furoda / Mujamalah Resmi Kerajaan Arab Saudi</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Tenda Ber-AC VIP di Arafah &amp; Mina Dekat Jamarat</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-1.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria